do actually uniform

00:31:11.086 --> 00:31:12.700
load balanced routing
in this network,

00:31:12.701 --> 00:31:14.255
okay, does that make sense?

00:31:14.256 --> 00:31:16.395
I see people nodding perfect.

00:31:16.396 --> 00:31:17.770
So, now let's do

00:31:17.771 --> 00:31:20.810
