00:31:34.091 --> 00:31:36.045
we have one meter
distance between those,

00:31:36.046 --> 00:31:39.170
and we can have
a different network

00:31:39.171 --> 00:31:40.640
or differently out but we put

00:31:40.641 --> 00:31:42.965
