of the data center.

00:31:42.966 --> 00:31:45.660
So, the interest which
links will be very short,

00:31:45.661 --> 00:31:47.520
but there will be
long wires coming from

00:31:47.521 --> 00:31:49.590
the endpoints to the switches.

00:31:49.591 --> 00:31:51.785
In fact this is a slightly
better configuration

00:31:51.786 --> 00:31:54.165
