00:34:57.211 --> 00:34:58.910
Even for 3D Torus,

00:34:58.911 --> 00:35:00.145
what is the reason for this?

00:35:00.146 --> 00:35:01.570
Because the 3D torus, you have to

00:35:01.571 --> 00:35:03.575
