00:35:06.726 --> 00:35:08.440
So, what you do is you fold it,

00:35:08.441 --> 00:35:09.960
and at the end once you've done

00:35:09.961 --> 00:35:12.390
all this folding and there's
arranging in the 2D space,

00:35:12.391 --> 00:35:14.650
the cabling doesn't look
very regular anymore,

00:35:14.651 --> 00:35:18.230
at least not to my limited
ability of assessing it.

00:35:18.231 --> 00:35:19.680
So, in fact I would

00:35:19.681 --> 00:35:22.780
