00:35:22.781 --> 00:35:25.660
would not look much more
complicated if you wire it.

00:35:25.661 --> 00:35:26.930
Because at the end what you do,

00:35:26.931 --> 00:35:28.465
when you wire these
or what I did,

00:35:28.466 --> 00:35:31.320
the particular Cray setup
is you have your table,

00:35:31.321 --> 00:35:33.470
your sheet of paper,
