00:35:33.471 --> 00:35:34.880
and then you take
the number of table

00:35:34.881 --> 00:35:35.940
into the number port here,

00:35:35.941 --> 00:35:37.130
and then you have to
make sure that it goes

00:35:37.131 --> 00:35:38.955
into the other number
port down here.

00:35:38.956 --> 00:35:40.615
I would assume we
could do the same,

00:35:40.616 --> 00:35:41.780
it's just that
the numbering would be

00:35:41.781 --> 00:35:43.715
a different permutation
of those numbers,

00:35:43.716 --> 00:35:45.510
