00:40:47.761 --> 00:40:51.165
It's a real simulations
for that network.

00:40:51.166 --> 00:40:53.360
Did I just say real simulations?

00:40:53.361 --> 00:40:55.770
Okay. So, we didn't
actually build

00:40:55.771 --> 00:40:58.475
