00:41:04.701 --> 00:41:07.555
To show the utility of
the Dragonfly topology,

00:41:07.556 --> 00:41:10.635
we took the same simulator
and ported it to Slim Fly,

00:41:10.636 --> 00:41:12.400
and here are some
simulation results with

00:41:12.401 --> 00:41:14.030
