will talk about in a minute.

00:41:37.406 --> 00:41:39.560
Okay? Well, some we'll
get to their destination.

00:41:39.561 --> 00:41:41.265
Here, we say, well,

00:41:41.266 --> 00:41:43.795
what if we send
zero packets per second?

00:41:43.796 --> 00:41:45.570
That's not close to
zero, of course,

00:41:45.571 --> 00:41:48.975
if we send zero, then we get
nothing but close to zero.

00:41:48.976 --> 00:41:52.655
Here, what if we send as
