00:42:30.066 --> 00:42:31.255
If you have no loads,

00:42:31.256 --> 00:42:32.890
well, the network is empty.

00:42:32.891 --> 00:42:35.200
Now, assume if we increase

00:42:35.201 --> 00:42:37.695
