00:43:05.661 --> 00:43:07.770
So, Dragonfly doesn't
fare all that well,

00:43:07.771 --> 00:43:09.050
that's because routing is very

00:43:09.051 --> 00:43:10.785
complicated on the Dragonfly.

00:43:10.786 --> 00:43:13.445
Here, we see Fat Tree
is the best one.

00:43:13.446 --> 00:43:15.320
Fat Tree has the latest
going to infinity,

00:43:15.321 --> 00:43:16.550
which means it has
