00:43:16.551 --> 00:43:17.820
but also twice the cost.

00:43:17.821 --> 00:43:19.540
But if you see,
this distance here,

00:43:19.541 --> 00:43:21.105
it's only like five percent more.

00:43:21.106 --> 00:43:22.350
So, once again, one
